WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.585
(Dinosaur roaring)

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:03.378
David Attenborough:
This is Prehistoric Planet.

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.379
(Dinosaur roaring)

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:05.839
♪♪

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:10.010
♪♪

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.388
David Attenborough:
There are many ways to describe
life on this planet.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:20.229
♪♪

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:22.439
David Attenborough:
Some creatures could be called
"magnificent,"

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:27.110
♪♪

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.237
David Attenborough:
or "monstrous,"

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:32.449
♪♪

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:34.326
David Attenborough:
perhaps "misunderstood."

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:36.245
♪♪

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:39.331
David Attenborough:
But only a few creatures who
roam this Earth...

00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:41.708
♪♪

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:44.044
David Attenborough:
...could be called all three.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:53.053
♪♪

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.973
David Attenborough:
Explore the coastlines where
giants roamed.

00:00:55.973 --> 00:01:00.060
♪♪

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.145
David Attenborough:
The deserts where danger rules.

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:06.066
♪♪

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:09.069
David Attenborough:
And ice worlds where survival is
everything.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:14.950
♪♪

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.618
David Attenborough:
Join us for a story...

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.537
♪♪

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:19.538
David Attenborough:
...you've never heard.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:23.458
♪♪

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.460
David Attenborough:
On a scale you've never
witnessed.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:42.728
♪♪

00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:44.396
(Dinosaur roaring)

00:01:44.396 --> 00:01:54.823
♪♪

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:58.618
David Attenborough:
Unknown. Unexplained.
Unbelievable.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:01:59.745
David Attenborough:
Until now.

00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:01.121
♪♪

